{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heartwarming visual novel <i>Yomegami: My Sweet Goddess~</i> , developed by renowned Japanese studio <strong>ALcot</strong> and published by JAST, has officially launched on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a  love story about the daily life of a demon reincarnation and goddesses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/a0a918d391f34e1ff91e768f06d03f30.avif?t=1756390468\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer: ALcot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher: JAST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artists: Shira Ichigo / Suimya / Hisama Kumako / Mikeou / Aona Masao (SD)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Writers: Soranoshita Hajime / Morry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG: Harunose Fumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: AngelNote</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/58f1dc8326864c9614a8ebbc130bca76.avif?t=1756390468\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a peaceful human realm oblivious to the gods\u2019 war, Hayato Narukawa\u2014reincarnation of a demon\u2014arrives in Masaireshin city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasked by his goddess mother Iris to atone through good deeds, he strives to redeem his past life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as he seeks a fresh start, a fated kiss with mob boss\u2019s daughter Ichijiku Mikoto risks undoing all his efforts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now entangled with a divine mother, a lovesick mafia heiress, a clumsy class president, and an innocent dog-eared girl, Hayato\u2019s hectic and bittersweet love myth begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 